flowchart TD
    A([PDF File]) --> B[Language Detection\nlangdetect]
    A --> C[Bulk Text Extraction\npymupdf4llm · once per document]

    B --> D
    C --> D

    D[Thread Pool · 4 workers] --> E

    subgraph E[Per-Page Processing]
        F{Page Classifier} -->|TEXT| G[Pre-extracted\nMarkdown]
        F -->|IMAGE · FORMULA\nTABLE · MIXED| H[Render Page\n150 DPI PNG]
        F -->|EMPTY| I[Placeholder]
        H --> J[LM Studio\nLLM Inference]
    end

    G --> K[clean_page]
    J --> K
    I --> K

    K --> L[Join Pages\nhorizontal rule separator]
    L --> M[postprocess_markdown]
    M --> N([Markdown Output])

